<title>USA: Motorola ups NetSpeak stake.</title>
<headline>Motorola ups NetSpeak stake.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>NetSpeak Corp said Thursday Motorola Inc has acquired an additional 452,855 NetSpeak shares by exercising a warrant granted in August 1996 in conjunction with its initial investment in NetSpeak.</p>
<p>Motorola paid nearly $2.5 million, $5.50 a share, for the stock, a NetSpeak spokesman said.</p>
<p>This additional investment increases Motorola's ownership in NetSpeak to 11.6 percent, the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;The additional investment in NetSpeak by Motorola is a continued vote of Motorola's confidence in our management and technology,&quot; said chief executive Stephen R. Cohen.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
